 \subsection{Qualitative Analysis and Mixed Evidence}
 The debrief will begin with broad experience questions, followed by balanced probes about voice preference, perceived performance, comfort, and potential uses. The coding process will record the initial codebook, revisions, coding decisions, and independent review of a subset. Contradictory or minority accounts will be retained rather than forced into one favorable theme.
