 \section{Status of the Research Questions}
 RQ1 remains unanswered empirically: no confirmatory voice-condition contrast in active completion time is estimated here. RQ2 likewise remains open because the final retrospective workload and motivation responses have not been collected for this report. RQ3 has a defined exploratory battery and debrief structure, but no participant judgments or themes are presented as findings. The literature motivates these questions; it does not supply their answers for this task.
 
-For EQ1, the platform and data contract provide a way to inspect sensing, state, decisions, and software playback separately. The October 20 alignment audit summarized in Chapter~\ref{ch:evaluation} supports specific implementation checks. The separate October 23 working-file inspection in Appendix~\ref{app:decision-contract} documents request, validation, and memory behavior in files whose deployment it does not confirm. Neither record provides a held-out guidance error rate or shows that all delayed confirmations have been removed. Together, these records describe the supporting apparatus and its current limits, while the question of whether the self-similar voice is more effective or more welcome than the neutral alternative remains for the participant study.
+For EQ1, the platform and data contract provide a way to inspect sensing, state, decisions, and software playback separately. The October 20 alignment audit summarized in Chapter~\ref{ch:evaluation} supports specific implementation checks. That audit does not provide a held-out guidance error rate or shows that all delayed confirmations have been removed. These records describe the supporting apparatus and its current limits, while the question of whether the self-similar voice is more effective or more welcome than the neutral alternative remains for the participant study.
 
 \section{Next Empirical Step}
 The immediate work is to freeze the study configuration, close the geometry and consent gaps, validate the full wearer procedure, and finalize the primary analysis and sample-size justification before confirmatory recruitment. The resulting data must preserve counterbalanced order, actual voice exposure, observation coverage, and the final retrospective survey references. Only then can this thesis replace its results framework with estimates and revise its abstract and conclusion around observed evidence.
